  "worked_solution": "Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.\n\n- Diagram I shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14134102/assets/a2632fa133ec55c1db7987c799ab0654f06dc6f919daea9d2c8121dad5a12341.png)\n\n- Diagram II shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14134102/assets/ab431babe2ab9b5fc1707ca12c91b1f8b3dbd0ccdc102e9ff090980d65052d6c.png)\n\n- Diagram III shows three points that are *not* collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14134102/assets/5adac57025cae294be0b8bc83a3905b4275d1bcd92b92ad6c126b3d1b108302f.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-154979\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Three (or more) points are collinear if a straight line passes through all points.</p>\n<p>With that in mind, let's examine our diagrams in turn.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram I shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-154979-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-154979-e-0\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram II shows three collinear points. There is a straight line that passes through all three of these points. </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-154979-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-154979-e-1\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Diagram III shows three points that are <em>not</em> collinear. We can't draw a straight line that passes through all three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-154979-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-154979-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"</p>\n</div>",
